:"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21683,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":3215530282,"text":"かつて、とある学者が言った——この灰燼の都の残虐な主は、アビスの侵食を止める方法を持っていると。それで我々は…","nextNodeIds":[750680403]},{"nodeId":750680403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21683,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":1234777690,"text":"だが、ここは実に不気味だ。この頃そう思えてきた。何かがおかしい、とな。","nextNodeIds":[750680404]},{"nodeId":750680404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21683,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":1685785538,"text":"昨日まで綺麗だった道が次の日にはボロボロになっている…あの石造りの家は初めからあんな風だったか？もっと…まともだった気がするんだ。","nextNodeIds":[750680405]},{"nodeId":750680405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21683,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":2085696778,"text":"それから、目が覚めたら、二度と現れるはずのない友人を見ることもある…あれは魔物だったんだろうか？友人の姿に化けた魔物だったのかもな。","nextNodeIds":[750680406]},{"nodeId":750680406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21683,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":4123800354,"text":"私の…私の責務は、ここの魔物を片付けることだ。だが、なぜ…そうしなければならない…？","nextNodeIds":[750680407]},{"nodeId":750680407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21683,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":3182744114,"text":"とにかく、ここはおかしいんだ…早く離れたほうがいい。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7506805,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["7504101","6","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomT